==Acquisition==
*This mod can be acquired by attaining the rank of '''Exalted''' under {{Faction|Red Veil}}, or the rank of '''Flawless''' under {{Faction|New Loka}}, and spending {{sc|25,000}} to purchase.

==Notes==
*Weapon [[Damage Vulnerability]] is affected by [[Ability Strength]].
*Does not affect damage over time (except for {{D|Blast}}).
*Affects {{A|Razorwing}}'s {{Weapon|Dex Pixia}} and {{Weapon|Diwata}}.

==Bugs==
*Does not work on {{D|Overguard}} despite it not blocking the attraction.

